<title>RUSSIA: Russia Feb sugar import up 24pct on Jan, 113,000 T.</title>
<headline>Russia Feb sugar import up 24pct on Jan, 113,000 T.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's total sugar imports in February rose 24.3 percent on January's level to 113,000 tonnes, the State Customs Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>The data, which the committee reported to Interfax news agency, put refined sugar imports from Ukraine at 65,800 tonnes in the second month, and imports of Cuban raws at 22,300 tonnes.</p>
<p>The committee gave no origins for the remaining deliveries.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
